WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Subtracting by breaking a ten

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:09.900
There are forty-two eggs in the market basket. A customer buys seventeen eggs.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.533
Forty-two minus seventeen.

4
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:18.333
We cannot take seven from two, so we break one ten.

5
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:22.200
Now there are three tens and twelve ones.

6
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:28.367
Twelve minus seven is five; three tens minus one ten is two tens.

7
00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:31.167
The answer is twenty-five.
